{"sha": "f2bf345e166ed9430bd3b8d6f44623cf95b2deb16250cf359daacbe81bed6e11", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g10:universal-gravitation} 章 --- 万有引力与重力}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:universal-gravitation:1}", "\\emph{1.} $F = \\num{6.67e-11} \\times \\dfrac{60 \\times 60}{0.80^2}", "= \\dfrac{\\num{2.40e-7}}{0.64} \\approx \\qty{3.8e-7}{N}$.", "", "\\emph{2.} 蚊子的重力为", "$P = \\num{2.5e-6} \\times 9.81 \\approx \\qty{2.5e-5}{N}$ --- 约比两名舞者之间的", "相互吸引力\\emph{大} $65$ 倍。人与人之间的", "万有引力比蚊子的重力还小。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:universal-gravitation:2}", "\\emph{1.} $P = mg = 55 \\times 9.81 \\approx \\qty{5.4e2}{N}$.", "", "\\emph{2.} 她的质量不变，仍为 \\qty{55}{kg}（所含", "物质的多少不变）。她的重力变为", "$P = 55 \\times 1.62 \\approx \\qty{89}{N}$ --- 为原来的六分之一。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:universal-gravitation:3}", "\\emph{1.} $g_{\\text{火星}} = \\dfrac{G M}{R^2}", "= \\dfrac{\\num{6.67e-11} \\times \\num{6.42e23}}{(\\num{3.39e6})^2}", "= \\dfrac{\\num{4.28e13}}{\\num{1.15e13}} \\approx \\qty{3.73}{N/kg}$.", "", "\\emph{2.} 在火星上：$P = 900 \\times 3.73 \\approx \\qty{3.4e3}{N}$；在", "地球上：$P = 900 \\times 9.81 \\approx \\qty{8.8e3}{N}$ --- 探测车", "在火星上的重力约小 $2.6$ 倍，而质量相同。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:universal-gravitation:4}", "\\[", "F = \\num{6.67e-11} \\times", "\\frac{\\num{5.97e24} \\times \\num{7.35e22}}{(\\num{3.84e8})^2}", "= \\frac{\\num{2.93e37}}{\\num{1.47e17}}", "\\approx \\qty{2.0e20}{N}.", "\\]", "月球对地球施加一个与之\\emph{大小相同}的力，", "\\qty{2.0e20}{N}，方向相反：万有引力是相互的。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:universal-gravitation:5}", "\\emph{1.} 距离加倍，$d^2$ 变为原来的 $4$ 倍，因此", "$F = F_0/4$.", "", "\\emph{2.} 距离减半：$F = 4F_0$。", "", "\\emph{3.} 两物体的质量均加倍，$m_1 m_2$ 变为原来的 $4$ 倍，因此", "$F = 4F_0$.", "", "\\emph{4.} 分子 $\\times 3$，分母 $\\times 9$：", "$F = F_0/3$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:universal-gravitation:6}", "\\emph{1.} $F = \\num{6.67e-11} \\times", "\\dfrac{(\\num{5.0e8})^2}{100^2}", "= \\num{6.67e-11} \\times \\dfrac{\\num{2.5e17}}{\\num{1.0e4}}", "\\approx \\qty{1.7e3}{N}$.", "", "\\emph{2.} $m = F/g = 1667/9.81 \\approx \\qty{1.7e2}{kg}$：两艘船", "以相当于一辆大型摩托车重力的力相互吸引。", "", "\\emph{3.} $a = F/m = \\num{1.7e3}/\\num{5.0e8} \\approx", "\\qty{3.3e-6}{m/s^2}$。即使不受阻碍，油轮也需要约", "5 天才能达到步行速度；实际上，水的阻力和系泊", "完全掩盖了这一引力。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:universal-gravitation:7}", "\\emph{1.} 托盘天平在两地的示数均为 \\qty{3.0}{kg}：袋子", "与标准砝码的重力都除以同一因子，", "因此比较结果不变。弹簧测力计所示的是", "重力：$3.0 \\times 9.81 \\approx \\qty{29}{N}$，在地球上", "$3.0 \\times 1.62 \\approx \\qty{4.9}{N}$，在月球上。", "", "\\emph{2.} 天平：它测量的是质量，这正是顾客", "所购买的东西。若弹簧测力计在地球上以“千克”标定，", "则同一袋在月球上的示数为 $4.9/9.81 \\approx \\qty{0.50}{kg}$ --- 店主", "就会以一袋的价钱送出六袋。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:universal-gravitation:8}", "\\emph{1.} 到地心的距离：", "$d = R + h = \\num{6.37e6} + \\num{4.0e5} = \\qty{6.77e6}{m}$。于是", "$g = \\dfrac{\\num{6.67e-11} \\times \\num{5.97e24}}{(\\num{6.77e6})^2}", "= \\dfrac{\\num{3.98e14}}{\\num{4.58e13}} \\approx \\qty{8.69}{N/kg}$.", "", "\\emph{2.} $8.69/9.81 \\approx 89\\%$，约为地表值的。", "", "\\emph{3.} 高空的万有引力几乎与地面一样强：宇航员", "漂浮，是因为空间站及其中的一切都绕地球\\emph{一起", "下落}（自由落体），而不是因为", "引力已经消失。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:universal-gravitation:9}", "由 $g = GM/R^2$，", "\\[", "M = \\frac{g R^2}{G}", "= \\frac{8.87 \\times (\\num{6.05e6})^2}{\\num{6.67e-11}}", "= \\frac{\\num{3.25e14}}{\\num{6.67e-11}}", "\\approx \\qty{4.87e24}{kg},", "\\]", "约为地球质量的 $0.8$ 倍 --- 金星", "与地球在大小和质量上几乎相同。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:universal-gravitation:10}", "\\emph{1.} 太阳：", "$F = \\dfrac{\\num{6.67e-11} \\times \\num{1.99e30}}{(\\num{1.496e11})^2}", "\\approx \\qty{5.9e-3}{N}$。月球：", "$F = \\dfrac{\\num{6.67e-11} \\times \\num{7.35e22}}{(\\num{3.84e8})^2}", "\\approx \\qty{3.3e-5}{N}$.", ""]}